ss&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1744836/d0d0f88d-3de2-4c79-b885-7b04398d9c2d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Modern, fully furnished living with an exceptionally large garden area – less than 20 minutes from Tesla Grünheide.\n\nThis high-quality 101 sqm, three-room apartment offers two bedrooms, two bathrooms and a spacious living and dining area. It is located on the ground floor of a modern residential development completed in 2021, close to the Spree river and Spreepark.\n\nA particular highlight is the approximately 245.64 sqm garden area designated for the exclusive use of the apartment, providing an unusually generous private outdoor space.\n\nThe apartment comes fully furnished and equipped for immediate move-in and includes two dedicated outdoor parking spaces.\n\nIts combination of modern comfort, generous outdoor space and convenient transport connections makes it particularly suitable for professionals, couples and families, including international tenants working in the Grünheide/Berlin area.\n\nAlso ideally suited to project professionals, expats and corporate relocations in the Tesla Grünheide/Berlin area.\n\nThe apartment is centrally yet peacefully located in Fürstenwalde/Spree, combining green surroundings with excellent access to Grünheide and Berlin.\n\nThe Tesla Gigafactory Berlin-Brandenburg is less than 20 minutes away by car. Fürstenwalde train station also provides direct connections to Berlin and Frankfurt (Oder).\n\nThe location is particularly attractive for families, with several public, private and international schools within walking distance. Supermarkets, restaurants, cafés and other everyday amenities are also nearby.\n\nThe Spree River, Spreepark, green spaces and walking and cycling routes offer excellent opportunities for recreation.","facilities":{"airConditio